{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ed has been many versions of himself, each leading to countless victories in the D.C.B. But now, he seeks something wilder. Answering the call of nature, he sets out on a new path - the way of the <strong>Beastmaster</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Armed with a crossbow and a debatable knack for animal training, Ed enters the training grounds to tame creatures of every shape and size. Each battle strengthens their bond\u2026and occasionally tests Ed\u2019s patience.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With up to four loyal pets fighting by his side, Ed will discover that sometimes the greatest strength doesn\u2019t come from power alone - but from the pack.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Class: The Beastmaster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the training grounds and raise your very own team of powerful (and adorable) pets</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Pets</strong> \u2013 Choose from eight pets, each with its own unique ability </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolve &amp; Bond</strong> \u2013 Feed and play with your pets to unlock new evolutions and craft builds for them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Squad of Four</strong> \u2013 Train and battle with up to four pets at once</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997780/extras/6d65985e92d6defeaf5dddd0658e2ce6.poster.avif?t=1762199397\" width=630 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997780/extras/6d65985e92d6defeaf5dddd0658e2ce6.webm?t=1762199397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997780/extras/6d65985e92d6defeaf5dddd0658e2ce6.mp4?t=1762199397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Game Mode: To be announced</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New game mode available\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Shiny Skins for all classes</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Unlockables\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 exclusive Beastmaster Skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Steam Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 New Challenges</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Environment:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the Training Grounds. Here, your pets take on a ruthless training regime, forging unbreakable bonds with every tumble and triumph. Every spit, yip, and strike pushes them to their limits - until they become as Talented as their master.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997780/extras/62b9c02919eca8bb61aceafca2a37e01.avif?t=1762199397\" width=608 height=348 /></span><i></i><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997780?t=1762199397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997780?t=1762199397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997780/0aa53394673ee8e4210dc86a0523e9e90d57c7c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762199397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997780/0aa53394673ee8e4210dc86a0523e9e90d57c7c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762199397","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description"